":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108871","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108871","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108871.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108871.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-25T13:17:03Z"},"body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91769 introduced a small hidden regression where texture clears are not performed the first time a texture is used, because resources are no longer individually tracked by the driver nor are transitions handled automatically. The resulting visual artifacts from not doing this is that there's some effects in the engine that rely on the texture data being zero-initialized, such as reflection probes being partially rendered. These show visual glitches instead on D3D12 devices if they support enhanced barriers.\r\n\r\nThis migrates that behavior to be used by RenderingDevice instead, which enables other drivers to use it. This fixed the rendering errors on my end for textures that were not cleared manually before being used.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108871/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108871/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}